    "title": "Lockett Named 2025 Delaware Mini Max Award Winner - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Terry Rogers ,\n12 hours ago Milford High School’s Gregory Lockett was named a 2025 Delaware Mini Max Award winner by the Maxwell Football Club. Lockett was only one of 46 student-athletes from across Delaware selected for this prestigious honor. Founded in 1935, the Maxwell Football Club is the oldest football organization of its kind... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
